# The build context: what `docker build .` sends to Docker. This is an allowlist. Everything is left
# out except the lines starting with !, so a new file (a secret, a dataset) stays out until it's listed.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src
# Only the generator's pyproject.toml, not its code: uv can't check uv.lock without every workspace member's
# pyproject.toml, but the API image never installs the generator.
!datagen/pyproject.toml
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
